= Generating CA Certificate =

Generate the CA certificate using the existing key with the following command:

<pre>
$ openssl req -x509 -new -key ca.key -nodes -out ca.crt -subj "/CN=CA Certificate/O=Example" -days 365 -set_serial 1
</pre>

Note: If you use a different serial number, specify the same value in hex in pki_serial_number_range_start deployment parameter (see [[Deployment Configuration#Serial_Number_Ranges|Serial Number Ranges]]).

